---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Sedi e contatti" description="Contatti e sedi dello Studio Piras a Quartu Sant’Elena e Milano.">
  <section class="shell py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">Sedi e contatti</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-6">Cagliari · Milano</h1>
    <p class="lead mt-9 max-w-3xl">Due sedi e un unico metodo di lavoro. Lo Studio assiste imprese, imprenditori e gruppi anche su operazioni e questioni che richiedono interlocutori e competenze su scala nazionale.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="rule shell py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-14 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14">
      {site.offices.map((office,index) => (
        <article class="border-t border-[var(--line)] pt-6">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[.06em] text-[var(--muted)]">0{index+1}</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-[1.65rem] font-semibold leading-[1.2]">{office.name}</h2>
          <div class="office-photo-frame mt-7">
            {index === 0
              ? <img src="/quartu.JPG" alt="Sede dello Studio Piras a Quartu Sant’Elena" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="office-photo office-photo--quartu" />
              : <img src="/milano.png" alt="Sede dello Studio Piras a Milano" width="547" height="350" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="office-photo office-photo--milano" />}
          </div>
          <p class="body-copy mt-6">{office.address}</p>
          {index === 0 && (
            <div class="mt-5 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">
              <p>Telefono: <a href={`tel:${site.phone.replace(/\s/g,'')}`}>{site.phone}</a></p>
              <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
            </div>
          )}
          <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold"><a href={office.map} rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">Apri la mappa →</a></p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[var(--paper)] py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="shell max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contatta lo Studio</p>
      <h2 class="section-title mt-5">Un confronto diretto, quando la decisione richiede chiarezza.</h2>
      <p class="body-copy mt-6">Per un primo contatto è possibile telefonare o scrivere direttamente allo Studio. Non utilizziamo moduli di contatto né servizi esterni di prenotazione sul sito.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .office-photo-frame {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .office-photo {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .office-photo--quartu {
    object-position: 50% 50%;
  }

  .office-photo--milano {
    object-position: 50% 50%;
  }
</style>
